    "ordinaryAdvanceUpper": "Saved per-codepoint glyph.rect.width plus 1px slack. New ordinary initial O in P2/P3 is unmeasured and bounded by assumption at 20px.",
    "finderAdvanceAndInkEnvelope": "Native selectable O/o with 33px advance, ink within the nominal 33x33 finder box, centered appropriately. No such gate-qualified glyph is known.",
